Package: satori-apt-sources
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: third-party APT repositories for satori
 Configures the APT repositories satori needs beyond Devuan stable: Brave
 (for Brave Origin), XLibre (for the X server), and Devuan's own
 excalibur-backports (for the kernel). Each repository's signing key is
 scoped to that repository with Signed-By, and APT pins restrict each one to
 the packages satori takes from it.
 .
 Brave's sources file uses the name and key path from Brave's own
 instructions, which makes brave-keyring's postinst remove the key it would
 otherwise link into /etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d, where APT trusts it for every
 repository. The key at that path is satori's checksum-pinned copy;
 brave-keyring's copy is diverted aside.
